{"id":1102681,"xmlId":"com.intellij.spring","name":"Spring","description":"<p>Adds navigation, auto-completion, and inspections specific to the <a href=\"https://spring.io\">Spring Framework</a>.</p>\n    <p>Features:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Coding assistance</strong>: Code completion, inspections, quick fixes, and gutter icons for Spring beans, autowiring, bean lifecycle methods, and profiles, across both XML- and annotation-based configuration in Java, Kotlin.</li>\n      <li><strong>Project logical structure</strong>: Visualize bean wiring and application context dependencies in diagrams.</li>\n      <li><strong>Spring Expression Language (SpEL)</strong>: Full language support, including completion, resolution, and context-aware variables for expressions used in caching, event listener, and similar annotations.</li>\n      <li><strong>Aspect-oriented programming (AOP)</strong>: Completion, validation, and navigation for aspect pointcut expressions.</li>\n      <li><strong>Persistence integration</strong>: Recognizes Spring-configured Hibernate and JPA beans for entity navigation, and detects the query language (JPQL, HQL, or native SQL) used in Spring Data JPA query methods.</li>\n      <li><strong>Language injections</strong>: Injects SQL, HQL, JPQL, and Spring EL into relevant Spring API calls and configuration for syntax highlighting and completion.</li>\n      <li><strong>Kotlin support</strong>: Inspections and code insight tailored to idiomatic Kotlin Spring code.</li>\n    </ul>","organization":"JetBrains s.r.o.","tags":["Framework"],"version":"262.8665.176","dependencies":["intellij.platform.backend","com.intellij.java","com.intellij.modules.jetbrains","com.intellij.microservices.jvm","com.intellij.properties"],"optionalDependencies":["com.intellij.hibernate","intellij.java.unscramble","intellij.spring","intellij.java.syntax","intellij.platform.commercial.verifier","intellij.database","intellij.java.compiler.impl","intellij.java.jam.impl","intell